cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this toolset or its reference data helps your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Balford deep drawing & metal stamping design toolset"
abstract: >-
  Command-line calculators and reference data for deep drawing and metal
  stamping feasibility checks: blank diameter, draw ratio and limiting draw
  ratios by material, die clearance, blanking force, bend allowance and blank
  weight, plus a defect-to-remedy table and a DFM checklist.
authors:
